      {
        "id": 12583,
        "name": "metaphysician",
        "username": "metaphysician",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-08T04:16:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We have numerous strategy guides for different heroes and villains, but none I can find for environments.&nbsp; So. . . what kind of thoughts do people have on the many environments, and how best to handle them?&nbsp; Which environments synergize with particular heroes or villains?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One discovery I recently made is that Grand Warlord Voss mixes oddly with Dok'Thorath Capital, because it has Minion flagged cards.&nbsp; The result is that you need to clear all the minions from there, too, to get him to flip.&nbsp; It also means that its that much easier for him to score his nonstandard victory, if your not careful.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:10.137Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
        "reads": 1,
