        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>We have numerous strategy guides for different heroes and villains, but none I can find for environments.&nbsp; So. . . what kind of thoughts do people have on the many environments, and how best to handle them?&nbsp; Which environments synergize with particular heroes or villains?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>One discovery I recently made is that Grand Warlord Voss mixes oddly with Dok&#39;Thorath Capital, because it has Minion flagged cards.&nbsp; The result is that you need to clear all the minions from there, too, to get him to flip.&nbsp; It also means that its that much easier for him to score his nonstandard victory, if your not careful.</p>",
