      {
        "id": 136846,
        "name": "bluedarky",
        "username": "bluedarky",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-08T05:45:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metaphysician\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metaphysician:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>One discovery I recently made is that Grand Warlord Voss mixes oddly with Dok'Thorath Capital, because it has Minion flagged cards.&nbsp; The result is that you need to clear all the minions from there, too, to get him to flip.&nbsp; It also means that its that much easier for him to score his nonstandard victory, if your not careful.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The same thing happens with the Mobile Defense Platform, on the plus side it does mean that you can leave out a mechanic to prevent Voss flipping if it's the first environment card played.</p>",
