        "raw": "[quote=\"metaphysician\"]\n\nOne discovery I recently made is that Grand Warlord Voss mixes oddly with Dok&#39;Thorath Capital, because it has Minion flagged cards.&nbsp; The result is that you need to clear all the minions from there, too, to get him to flip.&nbsp; It also means that its that much easier for him to score his nonstandard victory, if your not careful.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe same thing happens with the Mobile Defense Platform, on the plus side it does mean that you can leave out a mechanic to prevent Voss flipping if it&#39;s the first environment card played.\n",
